{"task_id": "HumanEval/36", "solution": "def _is_divisible_by_11_or_13(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by 11 or 13.\"\"\"\n    return num % 11 == 0 or num % 13 == 0\ndef _count_digit_7_occurrences(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts occurrences of the digit '7' in a number.\"\"\"\n    return str(num).count('7')\ndef fizz_buzz(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the number of times the digit 7 appears in integers less than n which are divisible by 11 or 13.\n    >>> fizz_buzz(50)\n    0\n    >>> fizz_buzz(78)\n    2\n    >>> fizz_buzz(79)\n    3\n    \"\"\"\n    total_count = 0\n    for x in range(1, n):\n        if _is_divisible_by_11_or_13(x):\n            total_count += _count_digit_7_occurrences(x)\n    return total_count"}
