{"task_id": "HumanEval/62", "solution": "def derivative(xs: list):\n    \"\"\" xs represent coefficients of a polynomial. Returns the derivative as a new list of coefficients. \"\"\"\n    derivative_coefficients = []\n    # Calculate the derivative for each term from x^1 upwards.\n    # The derivative of xs[i]*x^i is xs[i]*i*x^(i-1).\n    for i in range(1, len(xs)):\n        derivative_coefficients.append(xs[i] * i)\n    return derivative_coefficients"}
